  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n(A)/(2) = (B)/(3) = (C)/(7)\n\n**Calculation:**\n\n(A)/(2) = (B)/(3) = (C)/(7)\n\nFor A = 2, B = 3 and C = 7 \n\nA = B = C\n\nSo,\n\n(4A + 3B - C) : (A + B + C) = (4 × 2 + 3 × 3 - 7) : (2 + 3 + 7)\n\n⇒ (8 + 9 - 7) : (12)\n\n⇒ (17 - 7) : (12)\n\n⇒ 10 : 12\n\n⇒ 5 : 6\n\n**∴ The required answer is 5 : 6.**",
